@startuml Feature_UseCase

actor User
participant "Serial-Analog Bridge Board" as Bridge
participant "Analog Target Object" as Target

User -> Bridge: Send serial request\n(configure parameters)
Bridge -> Bridge: Save configuration

User -> Bridge: Send serial request\n(read analog value)
Bridge -> Target: Read analog signal
Target --> Bridge: Analog value
Bridge --> User: Serial response\n(analog read value)

note right of User
  User reads analog values
  via simple serial commands
end note

@enduml
